            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Deployment Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick up to 3 friendly **^^Deathrattle Infantry^^** or **^^Deadwalkers Infantry^^** units to be the targets.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Each target can use the &apos;Normal Move&apos; ability as if it were your movement phase.</characteristic>
