            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If any damage points were allocated to enemy units by this unit&apos;s attacks this turn, **Heal (D3)** this unit and each other friendly **^^Soulblight Gravelords Monster^^** wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
