            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 2+, pick 1 of the following effects to apply until the start of your next turn.
• This unit has a Move characteristic of 12&quot;. 
• Add 1 to casting rolls, unbinding rolls and banishment rolls for this unit.
• This unit&apos;s melee weapons have **Crit (Mortal)**.</characteristic>
