            <characteristic name="Effect" id="6d01-63c-ad92-5431" hidden="false" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time an attack made with this unit&apos;s **Fanged Maw** scores a critical hit, that attack inflicts 6 mortal damage on the target unit and the attack sequence ends.</characteristic>
