            <characteristic name="Declare" id="1088-2368-e036-a3ab" hidden="false" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit charged this turn, pick an enemy unit in combat with it to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" id="1550-f7fa-24e7-ffe3" hidden="false" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice for each model in the target unit.
If 3 or more of the dice have the same value, for the rest of the turn, this unit has **^^Strike-first^^**. 
If 6 or more of the dice have the same value, for the rest of the turn, this unit has **^^Strike-first^^** and the target cannot use commands.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" id="213e-1680-b892-7b67" hidden="false" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
