            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn, add 1 to hit rolls for attacks made by friendly **^^Deathrattle^^** units while they are wholly within 6&quot; of that objective or terrain feature.</characteristic>
