          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit is within the combat range of a friendly **^^Deathrattle^^** or **^^Deadwalkers^^** unit:
• This unit has **^^Ward (4+)^^**.
• Each time you make a successful ward roll for this unit, allocate 1 damage point to a friendly **^^Deathrattle^^** or **^^Deadwalkers^^** unit within this unit&apos;s combat range after the damage sequence for this unit has been resolved (ward rolls cannot be made for those damage points).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
