            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, while they are wholly within 6&quot; of this unit, friendly **^^Soulblight Gravelords^^** units cannot be picked to be the target of abilities used by the target other than **^^Fight^^** abilities.</characteristic>
