          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Movement Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">This **^^Manifestation^^** can only use this ability if it has not been set up this turn.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Remove this **^^Manifestation^^** from the battlefield and set it up anywhere on the battlefield more than 9&quot; from all enemy units. Then, roll a D3. On a 2+, this **^^Manifestation^^** can move a number of inches equal to the roll.</characteristic>
