                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a friendly **^^Deathrattle Cavalry^^** or **^^Infantry^^** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit&apos;s combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the ^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved.</characteristic>
