              <selectionEntries>
                <selectionEntry name="Beast Form" id="30bb-7ec0-6846-462a" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="3" type="upgrade">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Destiny Point Limit" typeId="bc33-05f5-8d3f-af43" value="-4"/>
                  </costs>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Beast Form" id="0a2e-6e5b-8b2a-7078" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
                      <attributes>
                        <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute>
                        <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute>
                        <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
                      </attributes>
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following units to be this unit&apos;s **beast form**:
• A **Dire Wolves** unit with 1 model.
• A **Fell Bats** unit with 1 model.
Set up the **beast form** unit within 1&quot; of this unit, then remove this unit from the battlefield. The **Beast Form** unit can use **^^Move^^** and **^^Core^^** abilities in your next movement phase.
If the **beast form is destroyed**, before it is removed from play, set up this unit on the battlefield once more within 1&quot; of it.
In addition, in any combat phase before **^^Fight^^** abilities are used, or at the end of any turn, you can have the **beast form** unit transform back into this unit. If you do so, set up this unit within 1&quot; of the **beast form** unit and remove the **beast form** unit from the battlefield.
This ability can only be used by an **^^Infantry^^** hero.</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
                        <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry name="Acolyte of Necros" id="b33b-0601-6f29-c0c0" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="2" type="upgrade">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Destiny Point Limit" typeId="bc33-05f5-8d3f-af43" value="-2"/>
                  </costs>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Acolyte of Necros" id="567f-a3a1-a26b-54b8" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)">
                      <attributes>
                        <attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute>
                        <attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute>
                        <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8"/>
                      </attributes>
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time this unit successfully casts a spell in your hero phase and the casting roll was an unmodified 10+, add 1 to this unit&apos;s power level until the start of your next turn</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry name="Fabled Heirlooms" id="e7ac-fc17-7fc8-a5f2" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="1" type="upgrade">
